OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry bright
OL,6,Fevening. The south and east will stay
OL,7,Fdry overnight with some clear
OL,8,Fintervals, while cloud and showery
OL,9,Flight rain reaches northwestern
OL,10,Fcounties.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith some sunshine and just the odd
OL,14,Fshower. A very warm to hot day.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FAnother hot and mainly dry day on
OL,18,FThursday with some sunshine, some
OL,19,Fshowers later. Cooler and cloudier on
OL,20,FFriday and Saturday, sunny intervals
OL,21,Fand a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
